FEAT-002-1-004-R001	FEAT-002-1-004	MOD-002	Immutable Audit Log Storage	Append-only immutable audit log storage ensuring no audit records can be modified or deleted — using write-once storage (S3 Object Lock/Azure Immutable Blob) with cryptographic integrity verification	must_have	audit-agent	Compliance officer verifies audit log integrity during quarterly audits	["Audit logs stored in append-only storage with WORM (Write Once Read Many) enforcement", "Cryptographic hash chain links consecutive log entries — tampering detectable via chain verification", "Log immutability retention period configurable per regulation — minimum 7 years for financial records", "Integrity verification job runs daily and alerts immediately on any hash chain break"]	pending
