FEAT-002-1-004-R009	FEAT-002-1-004	MOD-002	System Event and Infrastructure Audit Logging	Capture system-level events — service deployments, configuration changes, scaling events, failovers, backup executions — providing complete operational audit trail for shipping ERP infrastructure	must_have	audit-agent	Operations team reviews infrastructure audit logs during incident post-mortems	["All Kubernetes events (deployments, scaling, pod restarts, node changes) captured in audit log", "Infrastructure configuration changes (Terraform applies, Helm upgrades) logged with before/after diff", "Database schema migrations logged with migration version, SQL executed, and execution duration", "System event audit log correlatable with user action audit log via shared timestamp and correlation ID"]	pending
FEAT-002-1-004-R010	FEAT-002-1-004	MOD-002	Audit Trail for Approval Workflows	Detailed audit logging of all approval workflow executions in shipping ERP — booking approvals, BL release, invoice approval, credit limit changes — capturing each step, decision, delegation, and override	must_have	audit-agent	Internal audit team reviews approval workflow logs for compliance spot-checks	["Every approval workflow step logged: request, pending review, approved/rejected, escalated, delegated", "Approval delegation logged with original approver, delegate, delegation reason, and validity period", "Override actions (bypassing normal approval chain) logged with override justification and authorizer", "Approval SLA tracking: time from request to final decision logged for process efficiency analysis"]	pending
