FEAT-002-2-001-R001	FEAT-002-2-001	MOD-002	System SHALL enforce per-client rate limiting at the API gateway with configurable thresholds per endpoint, defaulting to 1000 requests/minute for booking APIs and 5000 requests/minute for tracking read APIs	System SHALL enforce per-client rate limiting at the API gateway with configurable thresholds per endpoint, defaulting to 1000 requests/minute for booking APIs and 5000 requests/minute for tracking read APIs	must_have			"Rate limiter returns HTTP 429 with Retry-After header when client exceeds configured threshold; tracking endpoint sustains 5000 req/min without throttling; booking endpoint throttles at 1001st request within rolling 60-second window"	pending
