FEAT-002-2-002-R001	FEAT-002-2-002	MOD-002	System SHALL achieve Recovery Time Objective (RTO) of 15 minutes for critical shipping services (booking, tracking, BL issuance) and 60 minutes for non-critical services (reporting, analytics)	System SHALL achieve Recovery Time Objective (RTO) of 15 minutes for critical shipping services (booking, tracking, BL issuance) and 60 minutes for non-critical services (reporting, analytics)	must_have			"Simulated primary region failure triggers failover that restores booking, tracking, and BL services within 15 minutes; reporting and analytics services restore within 60 minutes; RTO is validated quarterly through DR drills with documented results"	pending
FEAT-002-2-002-R002	FEAT-002-2-002	MOD-002	System SHALL achieve Recovery Point Objective (RPO) of zero data loss for booking transactions and BL records using synchronous replication, and RPO of 5 minutes for vessel tracking and schedule data using asynchronous replication	System SHALL achieve Recovery Point Objective (RPO) of zero data loss for booking transactions and BL records using synchronous replication, and RPO of 5 minutes for vessel tracking and schedule data using asynchronous replication	must_have			"After failover, all booking records created up to the moment of failure are present in secondary region; vessel tracking data has maximum 5-minute gap; RPO compliance is measured and reported after each DR drill"	pending
FEAT-002-2-002-R003	FEAT-002-2-002	MOD-002	System SHALL maintain active-passive multi-region deployment across primary (Middle East) and secondary (South Asia) regions, with automated health-check-based failover triggering when primary region health drops below 95% for 3 consecutive minutes	System SHALL maintain active-passive multi-region deployment across primary (Middle East) and secondary (South Asia) regions, with automated health-check-based failover triggering when primary region health drops below 95% for 3 consecutive minutes	must_have			"Health monitor detects primary region degradation below 95% threshold; after 3 consecutive failing checks at 1-minute intervals, DNS failover initiates to secondary region; total failover completes within RTO; failback is manual and requires operator approval"	pending
