FEAT-006-1-003-R005	FEAT-006-1-003	MOD-006	Verified Gross Mass (VGM) Submission	Customers submit container VGM declarations through the portal in compliance with SOLAS Chapter VI Regulation 2.	must_have			["VGM submission form captures: container number, weighing method (Method 1 or 2), verified gross mass (kg), weighbridge certificate number, and authorized signatory", "System validates VGM does not exceed container max gross weight and flags discrepancies >5% from booking declared weight", "VGM submission deadline is enforced per terminal cut-off (typically 24 hours before vessel ETD) with real-time countdown", "VGM data is transmitted to the terminal operating system via VERMAS EDI message (UN/EDIFACT) within 15 minutes of submission"]	pending
