FEAT-006-1-003-R010	FEAT-006-1-003	MOD-006	Document Version Control and Audit Trail	All documents maintain version history with complete audit trail of uploads, amendments, approvals, and downloads.	must_have			["Every document modification creates a new version with incremental version number; previous versions remain accessible", "Audit trail records: action (upload/amend/approve/download/delete), user ID, timestamp, IP address, and change description for each event", "Document deletion is soft-delete only; deleted documents are hidden from customer view but retained for regulatory compliance (7 years minimum)", "Audit trail is exportable as CSV and is accessible to entity compliance officers through admin portal"]	pending
