FEAT-006-1-003-R015	FEAT-006-1-003	MOD-006	Letter of Credit Document Presentation	Portal assists customers in assembling and verifying documentary credit presentations to banks under LC terms.	must_have			["Customer inputs LC number and terms; system maps required documents from LC conditions to available shipment documents", "AI checks each document against LC requirements: description of goods consistency, amount limits, latest shipment date, and presentation deadline", "Discrepancy report highlights any mismatches between document data and LC terms (e.g., partial shipment not allowed but multiple B/Ls presented)", "Compliant document set can be downloaded as a single bundled PDF or transmitted to the advising bank's document portal via SWIFT MT798 integration"]	pending
FEAT-006-1-003-R016	FEAT-006-1-003	MOD-006	Dangerous Goods Documentation	Specialized document workflow for hazardous cargo ensuring all IMO/IMDG documentation requirements are met before container loading.	must_have			["DG documentation checklist includes: DG declaration form, MSDS/SDS, container packing certificate, and approval letter from port authority", "AI validates DG declaration against IMDG Code: UN number, proper shipping name, class, packing group, marine pollutant status, and EmS", "System blocks vessel loading confirmation if any mandatory DG document is missing or fails validation", "Segregation validation confirms declared DG class is compatible with other DG cargo on the same vessel per IMDG segregation table"]	pending
FEAT-006-1-003-R017	FEAT-006-1-003	MOD-006	Phytosanitary and Health Certificate Management	Workflow for managing phytosanitary certificates, health certificates, and halal certificates required for food and agricultural commodity shipments.	must_have			["System identifies shipments requiring phytosanitary/health/halal certificates based on HS code and destination country import regulations", "Certificate upload validates issuing authority name, certificate number, expiry date, and commodity match against booking declaration", "For KSA-bound food shipments, system verifies halal certificate is issued by a SFDA-recognized certification body", "Expired or soon-to-expire certificates (within 7 days of vessel ETA) are flagged with renewal reminder to customer"]	pending
FEAT-006-1-004-R001	FEAT-006-1-004	MOD-006	Invoice Dashboard and Listing	Centralized invoice dashboard displaying all invoices with status, amounts, due dates, and aging summary.	must_have			["Dashboard lists all invoices with columns: invoice number, date, due date, shipment reference, amount, currency, status (open/partially paid/paid/overdue/disputed)", "Aging summary shows total outstanding grouped by: current, 1-30 days, 31-60 days, 61-90 days, and >90 days overdue", "Invoices are filterable by entity, date range (Gregorian and Hijri), status, currency, and amount range", "Dashboard displays total outstanding balance per entity and consolidated across all entities in customer's preferred currency"]	pending
FEAT-006-1-004-R002	FEAT-006-1-004	MOD-006	Multi-Currency Invoice Display	Invoices display amounts in the billing currency with real-time conversion to customer's preferred display currency.	must_have			["Each invoice shows amounts in the original billing currency (QAR, AED, SAR, INR, or USD) as per the entity's base currency", "Customer can toggle display to their preferred currency with conversion at the daily exchange rate published by the entity's central bank", "FX rate source and date are displayed alongside converted amounts with disclaimer that converted amount is indicative only", "PDF invoice download includes amounts in billing currency only; converted amounts are shown on-screen in the portal only"]	pending
FEAT-006-1-004-R003	FEAT-006-1-004	MOD-006	Invoice Detail and Line Item Breakdown	Customers drill into any invoice to view full line-item breakdown of charges with links to source bookings and tariff references.	must_have			["Invoice detail shows line items: ocean freight, BAF, CAF, THC origin, THC destination, documentation fee, seal fee, and any surcharges with per-unit and total amounts", "Each line item links to the originating booking reference, container number, and applicable tariff code", "VAT/GST is displayed as a separate line with tax registration number of the issuing entity (Qatar QFC, UAE FTA, KSA ZATCA, India GSTIN)", "Invoice detail includes payment terms (e.g., Net 30, Net 60) and applicable late payment interest rate per entity policy"]	pending
