FEAT-002-1-003-R003	FEAT-002-1-003	MOD-002	HSM-Backed Master Key Storage	Hardware Security Module integration (AWS CloudHSM/Azure Dedicated HSM) for master encryption key storage, ensuring shipping ERP cryptographic keys never exist in plaintext outside the HSM boundary	must_have	security-agent	Security officer performs HSM initialization and master key ceremony with dual control	["Master encryption keys generated and stored exclusively within FIPS 140-2 Level 3 certified HSM", "Key material never exported from HSM in plaintext — all crypto operations performed within HSM", "HSM cluster deployed in high-availability configuration across multiple availability zones", "HSM access logged with tamper-evident audit trail accessible only to security team"]	pending
FEAT-002-1-003-R009	FEAT-002-1-003	MOD-002	Data Classification and Encryption Mapping	Automated data classification framework that maps shipping ERP data fields to sensitivity levels (public, internal, confidential, restricted) and enforces corresponding encryption requirements per classification	should_have	security-agent	Data protection officer approves data classification schema and reviews automated classification results	["Data classification schema defines 4 levels: public, internal, confidential, restricted", "Every database field tagged with classification level in schema metadata", "Confidential and restricted fields automatically subject to field-level encryption enforcement", "Classification compliance report identifies any unclassified or misclassified data fields"]	pending
FEAT-002-1-004-R011	FEAT-002-1-004	MOD-002	Audit Log Retention and Archival	Tiered audit log retention with hot/warm/cold storage tiers — optimizing cost while meeting shipping industry retention requirements (7 years for financial, 5 years for operational, 10 years for customs records per some jurisdictions)	must_have	audit-agent	Compliance officer defines retention policies per log category based on regulatory requirements	["Hot tier (90 days): full-text searchable in Elasticsearch/OpenSearch with sub-second query response", "Warm tier (1 year): compressed and indexed in object storage with query response under 30 seconds", "Cold tier (up to 10 years): archived in Glacier/Cool Blob with retrieval within 12 hours", "Automated lifecycle policies move logs between tiers with zero manual intervention"]	pending
